                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Even though I’m only a few hours in heres my take. \n\nCendric has a charming story mixed with enjoyable pacing. I haven’t found myself doing pointless activities yet (like most RPGs), and I’ve continuously stopped playing and was waiting to play later. \n\nOverall it’s been a fun game so far! I’m enjoying the difficulty spike, the story, and the dialogue has been fantastic so far. The mix of serious subject matter and playful jokes/pop culture references really keep me interested in reading what everyone has to say. \n\nOverall I think Cendric will surprise anyone who plays it and thinks it’s your everyday RPG. It’ll surprise you. ;)",
